              "header": "菜单",
              "text": "<p><a href=\"https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/web-img-gallery/ballet_cafe0709.pdf\">点击查看菜单详情</a></p>\n<p><small>此菜单内容可能变更，请以餐厅实际供应为准</small></p>",
